  "lyrics": "1. Eagle spreads its wings wide, soaring to the sky high! Gopher digs a deep hole, digging down below ground!",
  "notes": [
   "Curriculum song (Prep A, prep-a.musical-alphabet). Warm-up in our own music and words: an eagle up, a gopher down (the parent's idea, Oct 4; the earlier letter-name words didn't line up with the sung letters). The letter names stay under the note heads. A pattern moved to the next C D E: up for the right hand, down for the left."
  ],
